models.py preserves upstream layers, crop offsets and six sigmoid outputs.
Local changes: fixed bilinear kernels are non-persistent buffers for device
and dtype transfers; removed the unused MATLAB VGG initialization path.
Inference wrappers and the NumPy adapter are local integration code.

train/ adapts the same upstream revision's train.py, dataset.py and utils.py:
RCF deep supervision, class-balanced BCE, SGD parameter groups and BGR/ignore
label preprocessing. Project additions and deliberate differences are recorded
in train/README.md. It has no dependency on the DDN training implementation.

